# C style, as Q2 Pod's firmware patch: 4-space indent, 100 columns, right-aligned pointers, one-line guards.
---
Language: Cpp
BasedOnStyle: LLVM
IndentWidth: 4
ColumnLimit: 100
PointerAlignment: Right
BreakBeforeBraces: Attach
SortIncludes: Never # order matters: a generated header can need the one before it
Cpp11BracedListStyle: false
AllowShortIfStatementsOnASingleLine: WithoutElse
AllowShortLoopsOnASingleLine: true
AllowShortBlocksOnASingleLine: Always
